Third-party packages bundled into the webview (webview/)
=======================================================================

The webview script (marp-preview.js) is built with esbuild from
@marp-team/marp-core and the parts of its dependency tree that end up in the
bundle. The list below is generated from the esbuild metafile by
`npm run notices` in webview/ (`./gradlew check` fails when it is stale), so
it names exactly the packages whose code is in the bundle, at the versions
from webview/package-lock.json.

The plugin ZIP ships the complete license and NOTICE texts of these packages
in webview/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt (inside the plugin jar), and the license
banners kept by the bundler in webview/marp-preview.js.LEGAL.txt.

